\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\">\n        <g id=\"01_02_home_R2_v1\" transform=\"translate(-270.000000, -1640.000000)\">\n            <g id=\"featured-event-copy-5\" transform=\"translate(132.000000, 1268.000000)\">\n                <g id=\"Group-4\" transform=\"translate(26.000000, 362.000000)\">\n                    <g id=\"Group-2\" transform=\"translate(25.000000, 10.000000)\">\n                        <g id=\"ticket-icon-o2\" transform=\"translate(86.000000, 0.000000)\">\n                            <image id=\"download\" transform=\"translate(12.894067, 11.777063) rotate(-44.000000) translate(-12.894067, -11.777063) \" x=\"2.15350081\" y=\"5.7770629\" width=\"21.4811321\" height=\"12\" xlink:href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image>\n                        </g>\n                    </g>\n                </g>\n            </g>\n        </g>\n    </g>\n</svg>Buy tickets</a>                            \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.theo2.co.uk/events/ical/piff-pops-magic-shoppe/4673\" class=\"ical-mobile-icon\" title=\"Add to Calendar for September 15 2026 at 6:30 PM\"> </a>                                <a href=\"https://www.theo2.co.uk/events/ical/piff-pops-magic-shoppe/4673\" class=\"ical m-button button-alt button-normal-hover\" title=\"Add to Calendar for September 15 2026 at 6:30 PM\">+ Add to calendar</a>                                                    </span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t</ul>\n\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"content_item textarea\">\n\t\t\t<h2>Event Details</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"event_description expandable\" data-options=\"event_detail\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t<p>Penn Jillette and Piff The Magic Dragon today announce that they will tour the UK for the very first time with new show Piff &amp; Pop&rsquo;s Magic Shoppe for 9 dates in September 2026. The tour brings together two icons of magic for the first time in the UK for an unmissable stage spectacular.</p>\n\n<p>This unique show is the result of the pairing of legendary magician Penn Jillette, of world-renowned duo Penn &amp; Teller, (who will tour the UK for the first time without his 50-year companion Teller) teaming up with comedy-magician phenomenon Piff the Magic Dragon, star and fan-favourite from America&rsquo;s Got Talent. These shows will also be London born Piff The Magic Dragon&rsquo;s (John van der Put) first UK shows in over a decade since he moved from his birthplace in Forest Hill southeast London to Las Vegas.</p>\n\n<p>Their brand-new show, Piff &amp; Pop&rsquo;s Magic Shoppe, promises a night of jaw-dropping magic, side-splitting comedy, and unforgettable showmanship. Split in two halves, Act one will feature a solo act from both Pop (Penn Jillette) and Piff The Magic Dragon along with Mr Piffles &ndash; the world&rsquo;s only magic-performing Chihuahua. Each will take to the stage to showcase their signature styles of magic, wit and wonder from Penn&rsquo;s sharp storytelling and world-class sleight of hand to Piff&rsquo;s eccentric comedy and offbeat illusions. Act two will see the pair return to the stage as a duo, blending their unique talents into a one-of-a-kind double act. Expect the unexpected as the &lsquo;Dragons&rsquo; combine forces into a larger-than-life finale.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Age Restriction: No under 5s</strong></p>\n\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div id=\"signup\"></div>\n<div class=\"edp-signup\">\n    <h2>Sign up for updates and pre-sales</h2>\n\t<p style=\"color: #00008c;\">We recommend signing up for alerts. That way you’ll be the first to hear about future ticket releases.</p>\n    <div class=\"edp-accordform\"><div id=\"prepform\"></div><script src=\"https://accord.aegeurope.com/api/?sitekey={30893CA7-8D52-2AE0-D516-6D7344BB759B}\"></script></div></div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\n\n<div class=\"right-sidebar-wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"rightBreakout\">\n\t\t<div class=\"rightBreakout-inner\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"extras\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ticke