h2>Event Details</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"event_description expandable\" data-options=\"event_detail\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t<p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:12.0pt; margin-left:0cm; margin:0cm\">Experience a hauntingly beautiful celebration of the unforgettable music that has defined the extraordinary worlds of Tim Burton &amp; beyond, brought to life by an incredible live chamber orchestra.</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:12.0pt; margin-left:0cm; margin:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:12.0pt; margin-left:0cm; margin:0cm\">Step into a realm where gothic fantasy and cinematic imagination collide. This year, The Great British Film Orchestra embarks on a spellbinding UK-wide tour, presenting <b>The Music of Tim Burton, Danny Elfman &amp; Beyond</b> - an orchestral journey through the iconic film scores that have become inseparable from Burton&#39;s unmistakable vision.</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:12.0pt; margin-left:0cm; margin:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:12.0pt; margin-left:0cm; margin:0cm\">For more than four decades, Danny Elfman has been the musical voice behind Tim Burton&#39;s most beloved creations. From the whimsical innocence of <b><i>Edward Scissorhands</i></b> and the macabre charm of <b><i>Beetlejuice</i></b> to the gothic grandeur of <b><i>Batman (1989)</i></b>, <b><i>Sleepy Hollow</i></b>, <b><i>Corpse Bride</i></b> and <b><i>The Nightmare Before Christmas</i></b>, Elfman&#39;s extraordinary compositions blend mischievous melodies and haunting orchestration into some of cinema&#39;s most recognisable music. His scores effortlessly shift between beauty and darkness, creating soundscapes as unforgettable as the films themselves.</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:12.0pt; margin-left:0cm; margin:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:12.0pt; margin-left:0cm; margin:0cm\">But the journey doesn&#39;t end there. This show also celebrates the wider musical universe <b>beyond</b> Burton&#39;s cinematic legacy, featuring unforgettable themes that capture the same spirit audiences have come to love. From <b>Harry Potter</b>, <b>Casper</b> &amp; <b>E.T.</b> to <b>The Silence of the Lambs</b>, <b>The Sixth Sense</b> &amp; <b>Psycho</b>, this concert brings together music that celebrates the wonderfully strange.</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:12.0pt; margin-left:0cm; margin:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top:12.0pt; margin-right:0cm; margin-bottom:12.0pt; margin-left:0cm; margin:0cm\">Bringing these extraordinary scores to the stage is <b>The Great British Film Orchestra</b>, one of the UK&#39;s premier ensembles dedicated to the music of film. Renowned for their rich, cinematic sound and immersive performances, this chamber orchestra transforms every concert into a theatrical experience, transporting audiences through enchanted forests, haunted mansions, moonlit graveyards and fantastical worlds where the impossible feels beautifully real.</p>\n\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div id=\"signup\"></div>\n<div class=\"edp-signup\">\n    <h2>Sign up for updates and pre-sales</h2>\n\t<p style=\"color: #00008c;\">We recommend signing up for alerts. That way you’ll be the first to hear about future ticket releases.</p>\n    <div class=\"edp-accordform\"><div id=\"prepform\"></div><script src=\"https://accord.aegeurope.com/api/?sitekey={30893CA7-8D52-2AE0-D516-6D7344BB759B}\"></script></div></div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\n\n<div class=\"right-sidebar-wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"rightBreakout\">\n\t\t<div class=\"rightBreakout-inner\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"extras\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ticket-button\"><a href=\"https://www.axs.com/uk/events/1412417/the-music-of-tim-burton-da