at Critical Role. &ldquo;In many ways, this adventure is just the beginning!&rdquo;Produced in partnership with AEG, each live show is a unique story, woven into the world of Exandria and brought to life by founding cast members Matthew Mercer (serving as GM for the first four shows), Ashley Johnson, Marisha Ray, Taliesin Jaffe, Travis Willingham, Sam Riegel, Laura Bailey, and Liam O&rsquo;Brien.&ldquo;We are so thrilled to be working with Critical Role again to bring their live shows to the world in 2026,&rdquo; said Eliza-Jane Oliver, Promoter at AEG Presents. &ldquo;We will be visiting some new and familiar cities in the Echoes of Exandria tour, including the first ever show in Germany at the Uber Arena in Berlin, the iconic arena in The O2 in London, Edinburgh Castle in Scotland, and two new exciting stops in the US, Atlanta and Fort Worth. I can&rsquo;t wait for Critters all over the world to be able to experience Critical Role live in some of the greatest venues in the world.&rdquo;\",\n\t\t\t  \"image\": \"https://www.theo2.co.uk/assets/img/CriticalRole-1080x1080-3c2bd6ab40.jpg\",\n\t\t\t  \"url\": \"https://www.theo2.co.uk/events/detail/critical-role-live\"\n\t\t}\n\t\t</script>\n\t\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\",\n  \"itemListElement\": [\n    {\n        \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n        \"position\": 1,\n        \"name\": \"Home\",\n        \"item\": \"https://www.theo2.co.uk/\"\n    },\n    {\n        \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n        \"position\": 2,\n        \"name\": \"Events\",\n        \"item\": \"https://www.theo2.co.uk/events\"\n    },\n    {\n        \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n        \"position\": 3,\n        \"name\": \"Critical Role Live\",\n        \"item\": \"https://www.theo2.co.uk/events/detail/critical-role-live\"\n    }\n]}\n</script>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
