\t  \"@type\": \"Place\",\n\t\t\t  \"address\": {\n\t\t\t    \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n\t\t\t    \"addressLocality\": \"London\",\n\t\t\t    \"addressCountry\": \"United Kingdom\",\n\t\t\t\t\"streetAddress\": \"Peninsula Square                                        \"\n\t\t\t  },\n\t\t\t  \"name\": \"The O2 arena \"\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t\n\t\t\"startDate\": \"2026-12-14T18:30:00+00:00\",\n\t\t\"endDate\": \"2026-12-14T23:00:00+00:00\",\n\t\n\t\t\"offers\": {\n\t\t    \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n\t\t    \"url\": \"https://www.axs.com/uk/events/1496540/mclaren-racing-in-conversation-live-tickets?skin=theo2\",\n\t\t    \"availabilityStarts\": \"2026-07-17T10:00:00+01:00\",\n\t\t    \"validFrom\": \"2026-07-17T10:00:00+01:00\",\n\t\t    \"availability\": \"Available\",\n\t\t\t\"price\": \"\",\n            \"priceCurrency\": \"GBP\"\n\t\t  },\n\t\t\n\t\t\t  \"description\": \"Every race has two stories. The race you watched from the outside, on TV or in the grandstands, and the one lived inside the garage. Now is your chance to hear the story from McLaren Racing&rsquo;s perspective. Fane is proud to announce McLaren Racing LIVE in Conversation at The O2, London on 14 December 2026.&nbsp;McLaren Racing arrives at The O2 for a one-night-only, first-of-its-kind event, with current McLaren Mastercard Formula 1 Team drivers Lando Norris and Oscar Piastri, Team Principal Andrea Stella and McLaren Racing CEO Zak Brown. Hear exclusive interviews and expect some special guest appearances from legends of the McLaren family over the years.&nbsp;It began with Bruce McLaren himself, a racing driver to his core who dared to build his own car, and in doing so, created one of the most enduring legacies in motorsport. For over 60 years, McLaren Racing has captivated the world. The only team to have ever completed The Triple Crown: winning the Monaco Grand Prix, the Indianapolis 500 and the 24 Hours of Le Mans. From Emerson Fittipaldi to James Hunt, Niki Lauda to Alain Prost, Ayrton Senna and Mika H&auml;kkinen - generations of icons and champions have shaped McLaren Racing into the team they are today. A team with 203 Grand Prix victories and 13 Constructors&#39; Championships to their name, and now, the second-most successful team in Formula 1 history.&nbsp;Join us as we reflect on McLaren Racing&#39;s rich legacy in motorsport, including their milestone 1000th Grand Prix this year, alongside a sneak preview of what&#39;s coming next across every series, from Formula 1, IndyCar, World Endurance Championship and F1 Academy.&nbsp;You&rsquo;ll also hear about a 2026 season that has already thrown everything at them. New engines. New aero. The most sweeping reset of the Formula 1 rulebook in a generation. They&#39;ll take you through it, race by race, lap by lap. The highs, the setbacks, everything in between.&nbsp;You cheered every qualifying lap. You lived every race weekend. You felt every result. Win or lose. This is your paddock pass to McLaren Racing, past, present and future.Alex Fane, CEO, Fane Group, commented: &ldquo;Fane has shared the stage with some of sport&#39;s greatest figures, but McLaren Racing LIVE in Conversation is in a category of its own. To have Zak Brown, Lando Norris, Oscar Piastri and Andrea Stella all together at The O2, for one night only, in the city that loves racing - this is truly something special.&rdquo;\",\n\t\t\t  \"image\": \"https://www.theo2.co.uk/assets/img/McLaren-Racing-LIVE_Square-1080x1080-33c2bf8500.jpg\",\n\t\t\t  \"url\": \"https://www.theo2.co.uk/events/detail/mclaren-racing-live-in-conversation\"\n\t\t}\n\t\t</script>\n\t\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\",\n  \"itemListElement\": [\n    {\n        \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n        \"position\": 1,\n        \"name\": \"Home\",\n        \"item\": \"https://www.theo2.co.uk/\"\n    },\n    {\n        \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n        \"position\": 2,\n        \"name\": \"Events\"