                                \"\n\t\t\t  },\n\t\t\t  \"name\": \"The O2 arena \"\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t\n\t\t\"startDate\": \"2027-02-28T18:00:00+00:00\",\n\t\t\"endDate\": \"2027-02-28T22:30:00+00:00\",\n\t\n\t\t\"offers\": {\n\t\t    \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n\t\t    \"url\": \"\",\n\t\t    \"availabilityStarts\": \"2026-09-15T16:00:00+01:00\",\n\t\t    \"validFrom\": \"2026-09-15T16:00:00+01:00\",\n\t\t    \"availability\": \"On Sale Soon\",\n\t\t\t\"price\": \"\",\n            \"priceCurrency\": \"GBP\"\n\t\t  },\n\t\t\n\t\t\t  \"description\": \"One of the biggest video game success stories of recent years is set to make history as Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 - A Painted Symphony comes to The O2 in London on Sunday 28 February 2027, set to be the first ever concert at the venue dedicated to a video game soundtrack.The landmark performance will be the only UK show on a major international tour taking A Painted Symphony to some of the world&rsquo;s most iconic venues. Led by composer Lorien Testard, vocalist Alice Duport-Percier and Orchestre Curieux, the official concert dedicated to the game&rsquo;s original soundtrack will bring the extraordinary musical world of Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 to life on an arena scale.Following an initial run of sold-out concerts across Europe, A Painted Symphony enters a major new chapter in 2027, taking a soundtrack that has captivated audiences around the world onto some of the biggest stages internationally. With Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 - A Painted Symphony, Lorien Testard has created one of the most remarkable original soundtracks of recent years. Ethereal melodies, powerful orchestrations and captivating vocal motifs accompany every stage of the Expedition, placing music at the very heart of the game&rsquo;s emotional impact and artistic identity.This outstanding achievement has been recognised with some of the industry&rsquo;s highest honours, including a Games Award for Best Score and Music. Named Game of the Year at The Ga